      "type": "section",
      "text": "CMI — Bank Service Initiation Requirements > Status labels\n\nConsent statuses must be translated from their API values into user-friendly labels before display.\n\nAPI status | Displayed label\nAuthorized | Active\nAwaitingAuthorization | Pending\nRevoked | Cancelled\nSuspended | Suspended\nPaused | Paused\nExpired | Expired\nRejected | Rejected\nConsumed | See below",
